  "meta": {
    "description": "Long SPY from the last trading day of each month through the third trading day of the next month (the [-1, +3] turn-of-month window), T-bills (BIL) otherwise. Decided daily from the NYSE calendar; with next-open fills SPY is held from the open of day -1 to the open of day +4.",
